OL,3,GNEWSABroken fence which cancelled      
OL,4,AParkrun to be fixed                    
OL,6,FA broken fence which caused a popular  
OL,7,FParkrun to be cancelled last week is   
OL,8,Fexpected to be repaired by December.   
OL,10,FJesmond Dene Parkrun, which regularly  
OL,11,Fgets several hundred runners every     
OL,12,FSaturday, was cancelled last week after
OL,13,Fthe collapse of about 130ft (40m) of   
OL,14,Ffencing caused a key route, close to   
OL,15,FPaddy Freeman's Park, to be shut.      
OL,17,FNewcastle City Council said works to   
OL,18,Ffix the fencing had been commissioned  
OL,19,Fand was expected to be complete within 
OL,20,Ftwo weeks.                             
